{
  "id": "979",
  "title": "Thank You",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-06-16",
  "synopsis": "Two primary school students did a good deed.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/979/5cdfcd299df18ea1d2814d82b42d033340634ad1.mp3?1592123990",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "谢谢你们\n\n    一天中午，两个小学生去学校。他们看见一个钱包，钱包里有很多钱。他们去找警察，警察找到了钱包的主人。钱包的主人很高兴，他想谢谢两个小学生。他给两个小学生很多书，有很多作业的书！不知道两个小学生高不高兴。",
    "traditional": "謝謝你們\n\n    一天中午，兩個小學生去學校。他們看見一個錢包，錢包裡有很多錢。他們去找警察，警察找到了錢包的主人。錢包的主人很高興，他想謝謝兩個小學生。他給兩個小學生很多書，有很多作業的書！不知道兩個小學生高不高興。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Thank you"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天中午，两个小学生去学校。",
      "traditional": "一天中午，兩個小學生去學校。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān zhōng wǔ liǎng ge xiǎo xué shēng qù xué xiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他们看见一个钱包，钱包里有很多钱。",
      "traditional": "他們看見一個錢包，錢包裡有很多錢。",
      "pinyin": "tā men kàn jiàn yí ge qián bāo qián bāo lǐ yǒu hěn duō qián",
      "english": "One day at noon, two primary school students were going to school."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "他们去找警察，警察找到了钱包的主人。",
      "traditional": "他們去找警察，警察找到了錢包的主人。",
      "pinyin": "tā men qù zhǎo jǐng chá jǐng chá zhǎo dào le qián bāo de zhǔ rén",
      "english": "They saw a wallet. The wallet had a lot of money in it."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "钱包的主人很高兴，他想谢谢两个小学生。",
      "traditional": "錢包的主人很高興，他想謝謝兩個小學生。",
      "pinyin": "qián bāo de zhǔ rén hěn gāo xìng tā xiǎng xiè xie liǎng ge xiǎo xué shēng",
      "english": "They went to the police, and the police found the owner of the wallet."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "他给两个小学生很多书，有很多作业的书！",
      "traditional": "他給兩個小學生很多書，有很多作業的書！",
      "pinyin": "tā gěi liǎng ge xiǎo xué shēng hěn duō shū yǒu hěn duō zuò yè de shū",
      "english": "The owner of the wallet was very happy. He wanted to thank the two primary school students."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "不知道两个小学生高不高兴。",
      "traditional": "不知道兩個小學生高不高興。",
      "pinyin": "bù zhī dào liǎng ge xiǎo xué shēng gāo bu gāo xìng",
      "english": "He gave the two primary school students a lot of books, books that had a lot of homework in them!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I don’t know if the two primary school students were happy or not."
    }
  ],
